/* 🌸 阳善公开滚动墙：柔和玫瑰金主题，与全站已确立的"阳善=暖色/公开"视觉语言一致 */
.yangshan-wall-card {
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF7FB 0%, #FFFFFF 100%);
  border: 1.5rpx solid #FCE7F3;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 20rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(190, 24, 93, 0.06);
}

.yangshan-wall-title {
  display: block;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #BE185D;
  margin-bottom: 14rpx;
}

.yangshan-wall-swiper {
  height: 56rpx;
}

.yangshan-wall-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10rpx;
  height: 56rpx;
}

.yangshan-wall-name {
  font-size: 27rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #BE185D;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  max-width: 200rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.yangshan-wall-amount {
  font-size: 25rpx;
  color: #374151;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.yangshan-wall-time {
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: #9CA3AF;
}
